n a 7-point scale. Value: {score: 3 like very much … -3 dislike very much}. Trial key = plot id. Analysis: SBE-style per-rater z-standardised score averaged per plot = landscape aesthetic service (LAS).\",\n      \"items\": [\n       {\n        \"name\": \"score\",\n        \"choices\": [\n         {\n          \"value\": 3,\n          \"text\": \"Like very much (3)\"\n         },\n         {\n          \"value\": 2,\n          \"text\": \"Very like (2)\"\n         },\n         {\n          \"value\": 1,\n          \"text\": \"Like (1)\"\n         },\n         {\n          \"value\": 0,\n          \"text\": \"Feel so-so (0)\"\n         },\n         {\n          \"value\": -1,\n          \"text\": \"Dislike (-1)\"\n         },\n         {\n          \"value\": -2,\n          \"text\": \"Very dislike (-2)\"\n         },\n         {\n          \"value\": -3,\n          \"text\": \"Dislike very much (-3)\"\n         }\n        ]\n       }\n      ],\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_01\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_01.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_02\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_02.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q7\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_03\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_03.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q8\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_04\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_04.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q9\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_05\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_05.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q10\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_06\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_06.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q11\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_07\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_07.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q12\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"plot_08\",\n        \"file\": \"plot_08.jpg\",\n        \"original_question\": \"Q13\"\n       },\n       